  "details": "Most noticeable is the water surface for the pool and waterfall has disappeared, kind of looks like the pool has been drained.\nhttps://steamuserimages-a.akamaihd.net/ugc/1008184995600183235/01CE66911CFABE1E588AC129A9CB0A15EEAE4E3A/\nWorld showcase portals do not update and are all stuck on the same thing.  Text on signs is also missing.\nhttps://steamuserimages-a.akamaihd.net/ugc/1007059784972844000/D83D937027B30E74623F1E201674EE96700A8B3C/\nMirror is broken\nhttps://steamuserimages-a.akamaihd.net/ugc/1007059784972843668/D1A76C2728C550A96EBDE9CE6D24FAD1E55C605C/\nThis all happened after the Unity 2018/Udon update.  I hope it will be fixed as I really loved the design of this world.",
